            "without saying you started it",
            "without saying it started",
            "do not imply it has run",
            "don't imply it has run",
            "not as work already begun",
            "not as work begun",
            "do not say you started",
            "don't say you started",
            "do not claim it started",
            "don't claim it started",
            "do not inspect",
